{% comment %}
    MERLIN GIVE BUTTON — opens Simple Donation's Merlin giving widget.

    {% assign merlinLabel = 'Give now' %}      (optional; default "Give now")
    {% assign merlinClass = 'some-class' %}    (optional; extra classes)
    {% include '~~/Assets/Lava/Partials/MerlinGive.lava' %}

    Merlin's install script opens the widget for any element with class
    open-merlin and a data-merlin-key, so the button is our own markup
    (btn btn--primary) and can appear several times on a page, in different
    blocks. The script is added once however many buttons there are.

    ROCK: merlinPersonId should be the person's Simple Donation id (the
    SimpleDonationPersonId the old "Giving Shortcuts" block looked up into
    personRow). Paste that lookup below; until then Merlin opens as a
    signed-in visitor without their saved Simple Donation profile, which is
    what the old block fell back to as well ('rockLoggedInNoSdPerson').
{% endcomment %}
{%- assign merlinKey = '01JB2RYN938GRYZTXJKXWM9RV9' -%}
{%- assign merlinColor = '97ca41' -%}
{%- assign merlinPersonId = '' -%}
{%- if merlinPersonId == '' %}{% assign merlinPersonId = 'rockLoggedInNoSdPerson' %}{% endif -%}
<button type="button" class="btn btn--primary merlin-give open-merlin {{ merlinClass }}" data-merlin-key="{{ merlinKey }}" data-merlin-primary-color="{{ merlinColor }}"><svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-gift"/></svg> {{ merlinLabel | Default:'Give now' }}</button>
<script>
  window.simpleDonationMerlinSettings = { personId: '{{ merlinPersonId }}', rockBusinesses: [] };
  if (!document.querySelector('script[data-merlin-install]')) {
    var merlinScript = document.createElement('script');
    merlinScript.async = true;
    merlinScript.src = 'https://merlin.simpledonation.com/js/installScript.js';
    merlinScript.setAttribute('data-merlin-install', '');
    document.head.appendChild(merlinScript);
  }
</script>
{%- assign merlinLabel = '' -%}
{%- assign merlinClass = '' -%}
